  | 2 => ⟨(204 : ℤ), (-18470227798043176821239253033342022256749081711104874297067 : ℤ), (1089328286510894683599474081734732832158834067378228804597296 : ℤ)⟩

theorem V_mem : V.mem (fTop c) := by
